  <content>
  <section><para>For functions \(f(x)=5x^2-4x-1\) and \(g(x)=x^2+3x+8\), find:</para>
<para>        \((f+g)(x) =\) _______ </para>
<para>        \((f+g)(5) =\) _______</para></section>
</content>
